        "original_id": "6ecd6a83-65fd-52d2-9b7c-a8bef8cbc77a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 68th World Science Fiction Convention, Denvention 3\n- Places: Melbourne Convention and Exhibition Centre, Melbourne, Victoria, Australia, South Wharf, Yarra River\n- Topics: Worldcon\n\nFacts:\n- Denvention 3 members selected the location for the 68th World Science Fiction Convention.\n- The 68th World Science Fiction Convention, also called Worldcon and Aussiecon Four, was held from 2 to 6 September 2010 at the Melbourne Convention and Exhibition Centre in Melbourne, Victoria, Australia.\n- The Melbourne Convention and Exhibition Centre is the name for two adjacent buildings next to the Yarra River in South Wharf, an inner-city suburb of Melbourne, Victoria, Australia.",
